# Only requirements.txt, api/, models/, tests/ and samples/ are copied into the image;
# excluding everything else keeps the build context small. Patterns without a leading
# **/ only match at the top level, so caches use **/ to catch every subfolder.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
.env
*.zip
*.log
data/
scripts/
training/
docs/
config/
README.md
docker-compose.yml
.git/

